    {
      "id": "super-ilu-519d16",
      "name": "SuperILU",
      "category": "SuperLUSupport",
      "signature": "SuperILU(Base)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Base",
          "type": ") :"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "\\ingroup SuperLUSupport_Module\n\\class SuperILU\n\\brief A sparse direct \\b incomplete LU factorization and solver based on the SuperLU library\nThis class allows to solve for an approximate solution of A.X = B sparse linear problems via an incomplete LU factorization\nusing the SuperLU library. This class is aimed to be used as a preconditioner of the iterative linear solvers.\n\\warning This class is only for the 4.x versions of SuperLU. The 3.x and 5.x versions are not supported.\n\\tparam _MatrixType the type of the sparse matrix A, it must be a SparseMatrix<>\n\\implsparsesolverconcept\n\\sa \\ref TutorialSparseSolverConcept, class IncompleteLUT, class ConjugateGradient, class BiCGSTAB"
    },
